ready confirmed you do not have to  link the account so this is not  something that is required now the other  thing that this confirms is all of these  different wand types i mean it confirms  that they are having them in hogwarts  legacy if we can link this so all the  wand types all the one cores basically  everything on the wizarding world  website when it comes to wands to me  this says that it is going to carry over  in-game which is absolutely incredible  so how do you do this and what else do  you unlock by doing this well to start  you're going to need to go to  wizardingworld.com  legacy connect once you're there you'll  need to log in to your wizarding world  account if you don't have one of those  set up yet it is completely free to do  so when you set up that wizarding world  account you'll be able to go through a  series of questions a little quiz and  you will get sorted on the wizarding  world website you'll also do something  similar to discover your wand type as  well so once you're sorted and have  discovered your wand you'll go back to  the legacy connect website make sure  you're logged in and then you can link  this to your wb games account now if you  don't already have a wb games account  you can make one of those as well that  is also free and this account will  connect to steam it will connect to  playstation connect to xbox now as cool  as that is linking it to your house and  linking it to your one that is not the  only thing that you're going to get by  doing this you're also going to unlock  some exclusive in-game rewards the first  of which is an exclusive house fanatic  school robe and i gotta say these robes  are fire you guys now i feel like every  time they announce something like this  we always have 50 other questions and i  can hear you guys now you're probably  wondering is there a way to get all four  of these exclusive house robes now in  the announcement video chandler wood did  say an exclusive set of house themed  ropes so